plore both inside and outside the classroom.\nApply to UW\nNavigation\nMain Page\nAcademic Programs\nLEARN MOREBachelors in Philosophy and Religion | University of Wyoming | UW\nFeatured Students\nLEARN MOREBrady Foreman Carina Ostberg Dane Jensen David EdmundsDesiree Shasa Johannes Raabe Levi LowderLisa Ohnstad Maya Wilde Michael Presho Rob Streeter Rowan DerrickFeatured Alumni Tanya N. BrownJenna Graye Hepp\nFeatured Alumni\nLEARN MOREFox NelsonSpencer HoltzJeff BaldockMakayla KocherDr. Tanya N. Brown Jenna Graye HeppKendall Eisele Roberts\nResearch Areas\nSteps to Admission\nSearch Programs\nDirectory Filter\nsearch\nDiscover Your Grad Experience at UW\nExplore Graduate Programs\nFind Your Career Path\nExplore Research Areas\nDiscover Research Facilities\nFund Your Education\nVisit UW Campus\nExplore Laramie\nMore About UW\nSee what's waiting for you\nChoosing UW means joining a graduate community with resources, support and opportunities\ndesigned to help you thrive. Get familiar with what\u2019s available to you as a UW graduate\nstudent, from academic and professional support to campus resources.\nStudent Resources\nContact Us\nSchool of Graduate Education\nKnight Hall\nRoom 250\n1000 E. University Ave\nLaramie, WY 82071\nDept. 3108\nEmail: GradEd@uwyo.edu\nPhone: (307) 766-6478\ninstagramfacebook\nThe University of Wyoming has earned its Research Level 1 (R1) status from the Carnegie\nClassification of Institutions of Higher Education, placing Wyoming's only four-year\nuniversity with the top research universities in the United States.\ninstagramtiktokfacebooktwitterlinkedinyoutube\nUW Operator: (307) 766-1121\nContact Us\n|\nReport a Broken Link\nA-Z DIRECTORY\n&\nPEOPLE FINDER\n\u00a9\nAccreditationWebsite HelpEmergency PreparednessEmployment at UWPrivacy PolicyHarassment & DiscriminationAccessibility\n\u00a9", "links": [["Skip to Main Content", "https://www.uwyo.edu/uwgrad/prospective/index.html#mainContent"], ["Skip to Footer", "https://www.uwyo.edu/uwgra